<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8"/>
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"/>
  <title>fonteboa</title>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Playfair+Display:wght@900&family=Lora:ital,wght@0,400;0,500;1,400&display=swap" rel="stylesheet"/>
  <link href="style.css" rel="stylesheet"/>
  <style>
    body.inicio { animation: none; }
    body.inicio::before {
      content: '';
      position: fixed;
      inset: 0;
      background-image: url('franzkline.png');
      background-size: cover;
      background-position: right top;
      mix-blend-mode: multiply;
      background-repeat: no-repeat;
      z-index: 0;
      opacity: 0;
      transition: opacity 2s ease;
      pointer-events: none;
    }
    body.inicio.bg-visivel::before { opacity: 1; }
    body.inicio nav {
      position: relative;
      z-index: 10;
      isolation: isolate;
      transition: opacity 2s ease;
    }
    body.inicio nav a { color: #fff; text-shadow: 0 0 12px rgba(0,0,0,0.8); }
    body.inicio nav a:hover { background: #fff; color: #000; text-shadow: none; }
    body.inicio nav a.active { background: #fff; color: #000; text-shadow: none; }
    body.inicio nav a.active:hover { background: var(--accent); color: #fff; }
    body.inicio .hero-text { color: #fff; opacity: 0.35; transition: opacity 2s ease; }
    body.inicio.saindo nav { opacity: 0; }
    body.inicio.saindo .hero-text { opacity: 0; }

    /* Modal */
    #modal-overlay {
      display: none;
      position: fixed;
      inset: 0;
      background: rgba(0,0,0,0.4);
      z-index: 500;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
    }
    #modal-overlay.visivel { display: flex; }
    #modal-box {
      width: 400px;
      max-width: 90vw;
      background: rgba(242, 223, 206, 0.95);
      box-shadow: 0 8px 32px rgba(0,0,0,0.22);
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
    }
    #modal-titulo {
      background: #000;
      color: #fff;
      font-family: Georgia, serif;
      font-weight: 900;
      font-size: 0.78rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.1em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 10px 36px;
      user-select: none;
      position: relative;
    }
    #modal-fechar {
      position: absolute;
      right: 12px;
      top: 50%;
      transform: translateY(-50%);
      background: none;
      border: none;
      color: #fff;
      font-size: 1rem;
      cursor: pointer;
      opacity: 0.7;
      transition: opacity 0.15s;
    }
    #modal-fechar:hover { opacity: 1; }
    #modal-corpo {
      padding: 18px 20px 20px;
      font-family: Georgia, serif;
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      color: #1a1a1a;
      line-height: 1.3;
      text-align: center;
    }
    #modal-contato {
      margin-top: 14px;
      background: #000;
      color: #fff;
      font-family: Georgia, serif;
      font-weight: 900;
      font-size: 0.58rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.08em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      border: none;
      padding: 6px 11px;
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: background 0.2s;
      display: block;
      margin-left: auto;
      margin-right: auto;
    }
    #modal-contato:hover { background: #ae3321; }
    #modal-email {
      margin-top: 10px;
      font-family: Georgia, serif;
      font-size: 0.82rem;
      color: #1a1a1a;
      display: none;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body class="inicio">
<header><div class="titulo" id="titulo">ficção breve de Luiz Fonte Boa, (1962- )</div></header>
<nav id="nav-menu"></nav>
<div class="hero-wrap">
  <div class="hero-text" id="hero">fonteboa</div>
</div>

<div id="modal-overlay">
  <div id="modal-box">
    <div id="modal-titulo">
      Luiz Fonte Boa: ficção breve
      <button id="modal-fechar">✕</button>
    </div>
    <div id="modal-corpo">
      Contos, ensaios e crônicas de autoria de Luiz&nbsp;Fonte&nbsp;Boa. Alguns textos contêm linguagem que pode vir a ser considerada imoral, violenta ou inadequada<br>a qualquer público.<br>Ficção literária.
      <button id="modal-contato">Entrar em contato</button>
      <div id="modal-email"></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<script src="layout_master.js"></script>
<script>
  initLayout('inicio');
  requestAnimationFrame(() => {
    requestAnimationFrame(() => {
      document.body.classList.add('bg-visivel');
    });
  });

  document.getElementById('nav-menu').addEventListener('click', function(e) {
    const link = e.target.closest('a');
    if (!link) return;
    const href = link.getAttribute('href');
    if (!href) return;
    e.preventDefault();
    document.body.classList.remove('bg-visivel');
    document.body.classList.add('saindo');
    setTimeout(() => { window.location.href = href; }, 2020);
  });

  document.querySelector('nav').addEventListener('click', function(e) {
    if (e.target.closest('a')) return;
    document.getElementById('modal-overlay').classList.add('visivel');
  });

  document.getElementById('modal-fechar').addEventListener('click', function() {
    document.getElementById('modal-overlay').classList.remove('visivel');
    document.getElementById('modal-email').style.display = 'none';
    document.getElementById('modal-email').textContent = '';
  });

  document.getElementById('modal-overlay').addEventListener('click', function(e) {
    if (e.target === this) {
      this.classList.remove('visivel');
      document.getElementById('modal-email').style.display = 'none';
      document.getElementById('modal-email').textContent = '';
    }
  });

  document.getElementById('modal-contato').addEventListener('click', function() {
    const u = 'fonteboa';
    const d = 'gmail.com';
    const el = document.getElementById('modal-email');
    el.textContent = u + '@' + d;
    el.style.display = 'block';
  });
</script>
</body>
</html>